WEBVTT

00:00:02.581 --> 00:00:07.688
Under Profile, Custom workout sets up your own ride. Telo Ride drives the bike's

00:00:07.688 --> 00:00:09.584
resistance; you pick how.

00:00:10.324 --> 00:00:15.343
It starts from GCN's thirty-minute HIIT: eight thirty-second efforts, the recoveries

00:00:15.343 --> 00:00:20.364
shrinking from three minutes to ninety seconds. Four other plans sit beside it.

00:00:23.228 --> 00:00:28.631
Each round steps on its own: efforts by five seconds, recoveries by fifteen. Add a

00:00:28.631 --> 00:00:33.938
round, remove one, or make every round the same. The plan then reads edited.

00:00:36.133 --> 00:00:41.476
Work and recover resistance slide from one to thirty-two. Warm-up and cool-down step

00:00:41.476 --> 00:00:42.984
a minute at a time.

00:00:46.457 --> 00:00:51.325
Flat resistance holds one level the whole ride: pick it, how long, and a cadence

00:00:51.325 --> 00:00:53.937
goal. You set the pace with your legs.

00:00:59.361 --> 00:01:02.184
Custom workout, from a phone to the full screen.

00:01:09.685 --> 00:01:14.288
Telo Ride, from the Telo family, turns a smart bike at home into a game.

00:01:14.633 --> 00:01:19.145
It pairs with the bike over Bluetooth, reads your power and sets resistance for

00:01:19.145 --> 00:01:20.816
every hill and interval.

00:01:21.161 --> 00:01:26.339
Two doors: Race (ride a map against your best-time ghost, bots or people) and

00:01:26.339 --> 00:01:31.787
Classes (ride along to a video, alone or with a group), fed by one progression of

00:01:31.787 --> 00:01:34.777
XP, rider levels, stars and map unlocks.

00:01:35.123 --> 00:01:37.615
A custom workout lives under Profile.
